commit 95dcced71560b7dc6a1d6c10c1833ee2b2175733
Author: gxh_1995 <aldPqlD8pFlEMl6X.gxh_1995@noreply.gitcode.com>
Date:   Wed Aug 12 15:45:14 2026 +0800

    Add mini-swe-agent runner: dead-loop guard, step logger, repo detection
    
    Switch pool configs to minisweagent backend + Qwen3.7-Plus so they run
    against the OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Add a wrapper around model.query
    that logs each IN/OUT step and force-submits when the framework nudges
    for a tool call or a post-PASSED grace expires — this stops the "task is
    done but framework keeps asking for tool calls" spiral we hit on
    astropy__astropy-12907.
    
    Also drop empty tool_calls before appending to history (DashScope rejects
    them), and fall back to instance_id for repo path detection when the task
    query lacks a Repository: line.
    
    Meta-model + judge get the same step-logging wrapper so SELECT / GENERATE
    / MUTATE / CROSSOVER / judge calls show up in run.log with IN/OUT bodies.
    
    READING_GUIDE.md documents the pipeline (7 STEPs, main data structures,
    call graph) so new readers can navigate.
    
    run_swe_bench_sympy.sh is a batch runner for sympy subset.

